    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n  <table class=\"narrative-table\">\n    <tbody>\n<tr>\n\n<th colspan=\"2\" scope=\"row\" class=\"row-header\">Knowledge Artifact Metadata</th>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"row-header\">Name (machine-readable)</th>\n\n<td class=\"content-container\">TrustDemoIND01</td>\n</tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n\n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"row-header\">Title (human-readable)</th>\n\n<td class=\"content-container\">TD.IND.01 Foreign doses imported as verified</td>\n</tr>\n\n\n\n<tr>\n\n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"row-header\">Status</th>\n\n<td class=\"content-container\">Draft</td>\n</tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n\n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"row-header\">Experimental</th>\n\n<td class=\"content-container\">true</td>\n</tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n\n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"row-header\">Description</th>\n\n<td class=\"content-container\"><div><p>Of the foreign DVCs a clinic scans to verify, the proportion whose dose is recorded as verified.</p>\n</div></td>\n</tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n\n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"row-header\">Measure Steward</th>\n\n<td class=\"content-container\">litlfred</td>\n</tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n\n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"row-header\">Steward Contact Details</th>\n\n<td class=\"content-container\">litlfred: <a href=\"https://github.com/litlfred/smart-trust-demo\">https://github.com/litlfred/smart-trust-demo</a></td>\n</tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n\n<th colspan=\"2\" scope=\"row\" class=\"row-header\">Measure Metadata</th>\n\n</tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n\n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"row-header\">Version Number</th>\n\n<td class=\"content-container\">0.1.0</td>\n</tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n\n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"row-header\">Measure Scoring</th>\n\n<td class=\"content-container\"><span title=\"Codes:{http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/measure-scoring proportion}\">Proportion</span></td>\n</tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    <tr>\n\n<th colspan=\"2\" scope=\"row\" class=\"row-header\">Measure Population Criteria</th>\n\n</tr>\n  \n  \n  \n  \n    <tr>\n      \n        \n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"row-header\">Denominator</th>\n\n      \n      <td class=\"content-container\">\n        \n        \n          <em>Description</em>:\n          <p style=\"white-space: pre-line\" class=\"tab-one\"><div><p>Foreign DVCs scanned for verification in the reporting period. Computation: COUNT of verification records (TD.J3A) WHERE &quot;Verified at&quot; is in the reporting period</p>\n</div></p>\n        \n        \n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  \n\n  \n    <tr>\n      \n        \n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"row-header\">Numerator</th>\n\n      \n      <td class=\"content-container\">\n        \n        \n          <em>Description</em>:\n          <p style=\"white-space: pre-line\" class=\"tab-one\"><div><p>Foreign DVCs scanned for verification in the reporting period whose dose was recorded as verified. Computation: COUNT of verification records (TD.J3A) WHERE &quot;Verified at&quot; is in the reporting period AND &quot;Record outcome&quot; = verified</p>\n</div></p>\n        \n        \n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  \n\n  \n<tr>\n  \n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"row-header\">Stratifier</th>\n\n  <td class=\"content-container\">\n    \n    \n      \n        <em>Code</em>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Record outcome</span>\n      \n      \n        <br/>\n      \n    \n    \n      <em>Description</em>: <div><p>verified, reported-unverified, rejected, not-read (TD.DT.01)</p>\n</div>\n    \n  </td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n  \n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"row-header\">Stratifier</th>\n\n  <td class=\"content-container\">\n    \n    \n      \n        <em>Code</em>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Failure reason</span>\n      \n      \n        <br/>\n      \n    \n    \n      <em>Description</em>: <div><p>the STT-VER-008 reason, for DVCs that did not verify</p>\n</div>\n    \n  </td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n  \n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"row-header\">Stratifier</th>\n\n  <td class=\"content-container\">\n    \n    \n      \n        <em>Code</em>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Issuing country</span>\n      \n      \n        <br/>\n      \n    \n    \n      <em>Description</em>: <div><p>the participant that signed the DVC</p>\n</div>\n    \n  </td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n  \n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"row-header\">Stratifier</th>\n\n  <td class=\"content-container\">\n    \n    \n      \n        <em>Code</em>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Facility</span>\n      \n      \n        <br/>\n      \n    \n    \n      <em>Description</em>: <div><p>the clinic that verified</p>\n</div>\n    \n  </td>\n</tr>\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\" scope=\"row\" class=\"row-header\">Generated using version 0.4.6 of the sample-content-ig Liquid templates</th>\n</tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>"
